                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EA fieldset groups together related fields, and is important for assistive technology. It should always have a legend explaining the purpose of the fieldset.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the fieldset includes all the fields on the page, the legend also needs to be the page heading as in this first example.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  }
                ]
